WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.625
Four merchant vessels approach the strait.

00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:09.775
Their crews see the shipping lanes; your command sees gaps in the coastal picture.

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:16.900
Build the radar and technology network, survey the sectors, and remove the mobile threats.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.775
Hold Passage Control until the last vessel is through.

00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:25.675
The lifeline ends where the open sea begins.
